      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the advice. the ginger tea sounds nice. but the 800mg every 4 hours... is that okay for someone right after surgery? i'm also kinda worried about the firmness because it doesn't seem to let up at all even when i'm lying flat, and it feels really uncomfortable to even breathe deeply. do you think i should try using a heating pad on my stomach to help relax the muscles and make it less hard?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
